Z||000000||GT Bastard||05-04-2000||05:32 PM||||I'm guessinge diff between the Getrag/Munice and Isuzu must have something to do with the synchros, but why am I hearing people say that this tranny can withstand a V8, and then others say it wasn't used on V6's because it's not tough enough to handle the torque? I'm wondering because I might purchase one from an '88 for my auto to manual swap since my 4sp tranny deal "fell through."||||reg||5
